  "notes": "pack_gemv4/pack_gemv_persist truncated the folded input to int32 before the dot product, so they did not compute a GEMV on real activations; the kernels and the host model now accumulate in float32 and the validation inputs are fractional. intel-step runs one full 2B decode step with norm/fold and every ternary GEMV on the A770 (host: conv, delta rule, attention, FFN elementwise, argmax), teacher-forced against cpu.Engine over a 4-token prefix. 2B only: no 27B pack on this host.",
